#: includes/class-cfbr-privacy.php:61
msgid "Suggested text for stores that use Checkout Fácil Brasil. Adjust it to the fields you ask for."
msgstr "Texto sugerido para tiendas que usan Checkout Fácil Brasil. Ajústalo a los campos que pides."

#: includes/class-cfbr-privacy.php:62
msgid "Suggested text:"
msgstr "Texto sugerido:"

#: includes/class-cfbr-privacy.php:63
msgid "At checkout we ask for your CPF or CNPJ and, depending on the store’s settings, your RG, state registration, date of birth, gender and mobile number, as well as the number and neighbourhood of your address. We use this data to issue the invoice for your purchase, to deliver your order and to contact you about it. We keep it with your order for as long as the tax law requires. This data is stored only in our store and is not sent to other services by this plugin."
msgstr "En el checkout pedimos tu CPF o CNPJ y, según los ajustes de la tienda, tu RG, Inscrição Estadual, fecha de nacimiento, género y móvil, además del número y el barrio de tu dirección. Usamos estos datos para emitir la factura de tu compra, entregar tu pedido y contactarte sobre él. Los guardamos con tu pedido durante el tiempo que exige la ley fiscal. Estos datos se quedan solo en nuestra tienda y este plugin no los envía a otros servicios."

